---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/i18n";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 Not Found — SpecMatrix Global"
  description="The requested specification sheet or comparison page could not be found. Browse verified EN/KO hubs, interactive lab tools, or open Global Search."
  locale="en"
  currentPath="/404/"
  isRootPortal={true}
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="lab-card bg-white p-6 text-center sm:p-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-rose-200 bg-rose-50 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-rose-700">
        HTTP 404 · SPEC NOT FOUND
      </div>

      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
        Page Not Found / 페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        The requested SKU, comparison pair, or route may have moved or does not exist in the
        verified SpecMatrix Global index.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-1.5 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        요청하신 제품 스펙·비교 페이지 경로가 변경되었거나 존재하지 않습니다. 아래 허브 또는 통합
        검색(<kbd class="rounded border border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px]">⌘K</kbd>)으로 바로 이동하세요.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <button
          id="open-search-404"
          type="button"
          data-open-search
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-xs transition-colors hover:bg-blue-700"
        >
          <span>Search All SKUs & Tools (⌘K) / 통합 검색</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 text-left sm:grid-cols-2">
        <a
          href={withBase("/en/")}
          class="lab-card group block p-4 transition-colors hover:border-blue-500"
        >
          <div class="font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-blue-700">EN · GLOBAL HUB</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-700">
            English SpecMatrix Hub →
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">
            WattCheck, PureGram, CycleGear & HomeTech TCO matrices in USD.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a
          href={withBase("/ko/")}
          class="lab-card group block p-4 transition-colors hover:border-blue-500"
        >
          <div class="font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-blue-700">KO · 한국어 허브</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-700">
            한국어 SpecMatrix 허브 →
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">
            KRW 기준 4대 버티컬 비교 매트릭스·국토부 기내규정·한전 TCO 계산기.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a
          href={withBase("/en/compare/")}
          class="lab-card group block p-4 transition-colors hover:border-blue-500"
        >
          <div class="font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-emerald-700">LIVE WORKBENCH</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-700">
            1:1 Live Compare (EN) / <span class="text-slate-600">실시간 비교</span> →
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">
            Compare any two verified SKUs side-by-side with custom priority weights.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a
          href={withBase("/ko/tools/")}
          class="lab-card group block p-4 transition-colors hover:border-blue-500"
        >
          <div class="font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase text-violet-700">INTERACTIVE STUDIOS</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-700">
            Lab Tools Hub (KO) / <span class="text-slate-600">도구 모음</span> →
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600">
            여행 충전 키트 조합기, 마라톤·사이클 보급 플래너, 30개 항공사 조회.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-500">
        <a href={withBase("/en/tools/")} class="hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline">EN Tools</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href={withBase("/ko/compare/")} class="hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline">KO 1:1 Compare</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href={withBase("/en/contact/")} class="hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline">Report Broken Link</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href={withBase("/ko/contact/")} class="hover:text-blue-700 hover:underline">오류 제보</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
